<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Limitations</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Interpretability of Conceptual Gaps.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Dependence on Model Competence.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Computational Overhead.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Evaluation Scope.</span></a></li>
