<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Position Relative to CoT and Implicit Self-Correction.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Hallucinating Gap Satisfaction.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px8" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Lack of Gap Prioritization.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px9" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Sample Size Constraints.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px10" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Design Effort Trade-Off.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S9.SS0.SSS0.Px11" title="In 9 Limitations ‣ GIER: Gap-Driven Self-Refinement for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Iteration Termination Criteria.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
